{"year":"2021","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 27th SAG Awards aired on April 4, 2021, on <i>TNT</i> and <i>TBS</i>, in a reduced one-hour, pre-recorded format because of the COVID-19 pandemic. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 556984, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Trial of the Chicago 7</a> (2020) won the cast award, and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 172069, 'screen_type': person}\">Chadwick Boseman</a> was posthumously honored as best actor for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 615667, 'screen_type': movie}\">Ma Rainey's Black Bottom</a> (2020). For the first time, all four individual film acting categories were won by people of color: Boseman, <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 19492, 'screen_type': person}\">Viola Davis</a>, <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 206919, 'screen_type': person}\">Daniel Kaluuya</a> and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1080935, 'screen_type': person}\">Youn Yuh-jung</a>. <i>Television awards are not included.</i>"},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":556984,"name":"The Trial of the Chicago 7","image_path":"/xvJJmdHVmOOn258tkCe6z83AYuP.jpg","director":"Aaron Sorkin","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":581859,"name":"Da 5 Bloods","image_path":"/sl2qDR4aRHW5bAJdfiFC4H2NKWZ.jpg","director":"Spike Lee","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":615667,"name":"Ma Rainey's Black Bottom","image_path":"/qAHr52Tzmn2Nywsj9bPb1V18jdm.jpg","director":"George C. Wolfe","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":615643,"name":"Minari","image_path":"/aQxf2xZjMoerIAqR8grFzPFNDaO.jpg","director":"Lee Isaac Chung","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":661914,"name":"One Night in Miami...","image_path":"/izMwtiJk4JaMTnW7UyJIpY1rAvd.jpg","director":"Regina King","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Actress","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":19492,"name":"Viola Davis","image_path":"/xDssw6vpYNRjsybvMPRE30e0dPN.jpg","winner":true,"movie